    start: 2004-02
    stop: 2026-01
    row: 20
    phases: 4
    tags: [web, community]
  - id: privacy-regulation
    name: Privacy regulation
    start: 2016-04
    stop: 2035-01
    row: 18
    phases: 2
    tags: [society, policy]
    description: From the GDPR, adopted in 2016, on.
  - id: decentralised-social
    name: Decentralised social networks
    start: 2016-10
    stop: 2035-01
    row: 22
    phases: 1
    tags: [community]
    description: Mastodon, then Bluesky, social networks nobody owns outright.
  - id: ai-answer-engines
    name: AI answer engines
    start: 2022-12
    stop: 2035-01
    row: 24
    phases: 1
    tags: [web, ai]
    description: Asking a model instead of scanning ten blue links.
  - id: dot-com-bubble
    name: Dot-com bubble
    start: 1995-08
    stop: 2003-01
    row: 32
    phases: 4
    peak-end: 2000-03
    trough-end: 2002-10
    slope-end: 2002-12
    tags: [business, finance]
    description: From Netscape's listing in 1995 to the crash.
  - id: e-commerce
    name: E-commerce
    start: 1995-07
    stop: 2020-01
    row: 30
    phases: 4
    tags: [business]
  - id: peer-to-peer-sharing
    name: Peer-to-peer file sharing
    start: 1999-06
    stop: 2012-01
    row: 36
    phases: 3
    tags: [media]
    description: Napster in 1999, then its many successors.
  - id: streaming-media
    name: Streaming media
    start: 2005-02
    stop: 2026-01
    row: 32
    phases: 4
    tags: [media]
  - id: internet-of-things
    name: Internet of things
    start: 1999-01
    stop: 2030-01
    row: 34
    phases: 3
    tags: [devices]
  - id: web3
    name: Web3 and blockchain
    start: 2014-04
    stop: 2032-01
    row: 38
    phases: 2
    peak-end: 2022-01
    tags: [web, finance]
  - id: agentic-web
    name: Agentic web
    start: 2026-01
    stop: 2040-01
    row: 40
    phases: 1
    tags: [web, ai, upcoming]
    description: Agents browsing, buying and negotiating on people's behalf.
  - id: 6g
    name: 6G
    start: 2030-01
    stop: 2045-01
    row: 42
    phases: 1
    tags: [access, upcoming]
  - id: quantum-internet
    name: Quantum internet
    start: 2032-01
    stop: 2050-01
    row: 44
    phases: 1
    tags: [networking, conceptual]
    description: Entangled links whose messages cannot be read in transit without it showing.
  - id: interplanetary-internet
    name: Interplanetary internet
    start: 2035-01
    stop: 2055-01
    row: 46
    phases: 1
    tags: [networking, space, conceptual]
    description: Delay-tolerant networking between Earth, the Moon and Mars, as Vint Cerf proposed.
